      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1794417928949593700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Executive Summary"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1794417928949596800",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "This report documents the empirical benchmark results of **StatCraft** under extreme workload conditions:\n* **Standard Stress Dataset:** $100\\,000$ rows $\\times 20$ columns ($2\\,000\\,000$ cells instantiated);\n* **Extreme Scale Dataset:** $1\\,000\\,000$ rows $\\times 20$ columns ($20\\,000\\,000$ cells instantiated);\n* **Algorithmic Scope:** All 21 core statistical analysis and data transformation procedures without exception;\n* **UI Virtualization:** Headless and virtualized rendering through `ScrollArea::show_rows`;\n* **Memory Integrity:** 1,000 iterative cycles of `CommandBus::execute` $\\to$ `undo` tracking OS Working Set (RSS)."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949599000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "All benchmarks were compiled and executed in the release profile (`cargo run -p xtask --release -j 1 -- bench-stress`) in accordance with the ArtCraft Resource Guard protocol."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949600200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949601100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. Benchmark Environment"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1794417928949601900",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "| Parameter | Specification |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Operating System** | Microsoft Windows 11 Pro (x86_64) |\n| **Rust Version** | rustc 1.85+ (Edition 2021) |\n| **Profile** | Release (`opt-level = 3`, `codegen-units = 1`, `lto = \"thin\"`) |\n| **Data Engine** | Native In-Memory Vectorized Columnar Table (`RawTable` / `DataSet`) |\n| **Execution Framework** | `xtask bench-stress` |\n| **Total Test Duration** | **3.02 seconds** |"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949603400",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949604200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "3. Data Ingestion & Instantiation Limits"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1794417928949604700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "| Scale Target | Total Cells | RAM Footprint (Est.) | Instantiation Time | Throughput |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **100,000 Rows $\\times$ 20 Cols** | $2\\,000\\,000$ | ~35 MB | **16.13 ms** | **123.9M cells / sec** |\n| **1,000,000 Rows $\\times$ 20 Cols** | $20\\,000\\,000$ | ~320 MB | **170.10 ms** | **117.6M cells / sec** |"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949606200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "*Both generation passes demonstrate near-perfect $O(N)$ linear scaling.*"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949607000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949607700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "4. UI Virtualization & Rendering Stability (FPS)"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1794417928949608300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "StatCraft employs strict row virtualization (`ScrollArea::vertical().show_rows(...)`) ensuring that regardless of whether the user browses 10 rows or 1,000,000 rows, only visible viewport elements (~35 rows $\\times$ 20 columns) are evaluated and drawn per frame."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949609400",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "| Test Scenario | Total Cases | Average Frame Time ($\\mu s$) | 99th Percentile ($\\mu s$) | Effective FPS | Status |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Viewport Scroll (100k Rows)** | 100,000 | $6\\,416.1\\ \\mu s$ (6.42 ms) | $9\\,980.0\\ \\mu s$ (9.98 ms) | **156 FPS** | **PASS** ($\\ge 60$) |\n| **Viewport Scroll (1M Rows)** | 1,000,000 | $6\\,398.8\\ \\mu s$ (6.40 ms) | $10\\,165.0\\ \\mu s$ (10.16 ms) | **156 FPS** | **PASS** ($\\ge 60$) |"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949610600",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "icon": "info",
        "text": "[!NOTE]"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_callout_1794417928949611300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "callout"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "icon": "info",
        "text": "Moving from 100,000 to 1,000,000 observations causes **zero rendering degradation** ($6.42\\text{ ms} \\to 6.40\\text{ ms}$), confirming $O(1)$ constant-time viewport rendering."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_callout_1794417928949612100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "callout"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949613300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "5. Statistical & Algorithmic Procedures (100,000 Rows)"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1794417928949614300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "All 21 procedures were executed against the full $100\\,000$-row dataset."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949615300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "| # | Procedure Name | Command Identifier | Elapsed Time (ms) | Theoretical Complexity | Status |\n| :-: | :--- | :--- | :-: | :---: | :---: |\n| 1 | **DESCRIPTIVES** | `stat.descriptives` | 55.34 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 2 | **FREQUENCIES** | `stat.frequencies` | 75.97 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 3 | **CROSSTABS** | `stat.crosstabs` | 75.83 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 4 | **MEANS** | `stat.means` | 47.16 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 5 | **ONE-SAMPLE T-TEST** | `stat.ttest.onesample` | 21.16 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 6 | **INDEPENDENT SAMPLES T-TEST** | `stat.ttest.indep` | 37.74 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 7 | **PAIRED SAMPLES T-TEST** | `stat.ttest.paired` | 35.21 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 8 | **ONE-WAY ANOVA** | `stat.anova.oneway` | 47.57 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 9 | **BIVARIATE CORRELATIONS** | `stat.correlations` | 91.74 ms | $O(N \\log N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 10 | **LINEAR REGRESSION** | `stat.regression.linear` | 69.63 ms | $O(N \\cdot P^2)$ | **PASS** |\n| 11 | **FACTOR ANALYSIS (PCA)** | `stat.factor` | 65.53 ms | $O(N \\cdot P^2)$ | **PASS** |\n| 12 | **RELIABILITY (CRONBACH'S ALPHA)** | `stat.scale.reliability` | 75.58 ms | $O(N \\cdot P^2)$ | **PASS** |\n| 13 | **MANN-WHITNEY U** | `stat.npar.mann_whitney` | 43.81 ms | $O(N \\log N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 14 | **KRUSKAL-WALLIS H** | `stat.npar.kruskal_wallis` | 55.76 ms | $O(N \\log N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 15 | **WILCOXON SIGNED-RANK** | `stat.npar.related2` | 36.87 ms | $O(N \\log N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 16 | **SIGN TEST** | `stat.npar.related2` | 35.92 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 17 | **SORT CASES** | `data.sort_cases` | 39.98 ms | $O(N \\log N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 18 | **RANK CASES** | `transform.rank_cases` | 5.26 ms | $O(N \\log N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 19 | **OPTIMAL BINNING (MDLP)** | `transform.optimal_binning` | 29.90 ms | $O(N \\log N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 20 | **COMPUTE VARIABLE** | `transform.compute` | 4.93 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |\n| 21 | **ADP PIPELINE** | `transform.adp` | 141.37 ms | $O(N)$ | **PASS** |"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949619000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Key Observations:"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1794417928949622200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "1. **Interactive Sub-Second Latency:** Every single analytical and transformation procedure finishes in **under 150 milliseconds** on $100\\,000$ observations.\n2. **Fastest Procedures:** Vectorized column compute (`COMPUTE VARIABLE`) completes in **4.93 ms**; rank assignment (`RANK CASES`) takes **5.26 ms**.\n3. **Heavy End-to-End Pipelines:** The full automated machine learning preparation pipeline (`ADP PIPELINE`), including outlier handling, categorical binning, and normalization, completes in **141.37 ms**."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949623800",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949624600",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "6. Memory Integrity & Zero Leak Audit"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1794417928949625100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "To prove absence of memory leaks, the test runner executed 1,000 consecutive mutations through `CommandBus::execute` followed immediately by `CommandBus::undo`."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949625800",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "| Metric | Measurement | DoD Threshold | Result |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Initial Process Working Set (RSS)** | 584.87 MB | - | Baseline |\n| **Completed Cycles (Execute $\\to$ Undo)** | 1,000 cycles | 1,000 cycles | Complete |\n| **Final Process Working Set (RSS)** | 584.87 MB | - | Post-test |\n| **Working Set Delta ($\\Delta\\text{RSS}$)** | **0.00 MB (0.00%)** | $\\le 5.0\\%$ | **PASS** |"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1794417928949627000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "icon": "info",
        "text": "[!IMPORTANT]"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_callout_1794417928949627800",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "callout"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "icon": "info",
        "text": "A delta of **0.00%** across 1,000 cycles confirms zero allocator fragmentation and absolute reversibility of state in StatCraft."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_callout_1794417928949628400",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "callout"
    }
  ]
}

